│ patch_name               │ beam_greedy_2opt_restart                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ Instead of a single randomized greedy pass, this approach runs many independent greedy    │
│                          │ constructions with different starting transactions (multi-restart diversification), then  │
│                          │ improves the best schedule with a first-improvement 2-opt swap local search. The greedy   │
│                          │ step uses exact makespan evaluation via `get_opt_seq_cost` of the partial sequence to     │
│                          │ pick the next transaction (least-increase greedy), which the original already did         │
│                          │ partially but only once with sampling noise. Adding beam-style restarts + local search    │
│                          │ escape local optima and reliably lower makespan.                                          │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
