│ patch_type               │ cross                                                                                     │
│ patch_name               │ sa_hybrid_insert_swap_multistart                                                          │
│ patch_description        │ Crossover combining the current program's best-performing simulated annealing (SA)        │
│                          │ framework with the alternate programs' local-search neighborhoods. Key improvements:      │
│                          │ 1. Keep randomized greedy sampling for initial solutions (as in both parents).            │
│                          │ 2. Replace the pure-insertion SA move with a mixed neighborhood: random insertion (from   │
│                          │ the current best-scoring program) and adjacent/segment swaps (from the crossover          │
│                          │ program), since different move types escape different local optima.                       │
│                          │ 3. Periodically restart SA from the best-so-far solution with reheating when the search   │
│                          │ stagnates, acting as iterated local search — this mixes the SA convergence of the current │
│                          │ program with the multi-restart robustness of the greedy-restart parent.                   │
│                          │ 4. Reheat/temperature schedule tuned relative to best_cost, accepting occasional uphill   │
│                          │ moves early and mostly downhill later, which reliably drove the current program to        │
│                          │ makespan 244.                                                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This yields more thorough exploration of the schedule space within the time budget,       │
│                          │ leading to lower makespan.                                                                │
