│ patch_description        │ Combines the cost-guided greedy sampling from prior programs with a ruin-and-recreate     │
│                          │ perturbation loop: repeatedly remove a random segment of 3-5 transactions from the        │
│                          │ current best schedule and greedily re-insert them at all positions, evaluating real       │
│                          │ makespan via get_opt_seq_cost. This diversifies restarts while preserving the cost-based  │
